  "verdict": {
    "headline": "A focused counters deck that wins by doubling proliferate, held back by blue mana and thin redundancy.",
    "summary": "Atraxa's proliferate plus doublers is a coherent plan with strong ramp and interaction. The main risks are a single point of failure on the commander, an underfed blue half, and a top-heavy curve. Three swaps address the first two.",
    "grade": "B",
    "confidence": 0.78
  },
